{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026za3f1MzsSP1792660295.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平特別代表、外長王毅日前在阿塞拜疆首都巴庫，出席亞洲相互協作與信任措施會議第七次峰會，該會議是亞洲地區重要的安全對話與合作平台。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_20261022_QQ.CICA.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uc9qpCvvCw1792664769.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>亞洲相互協作與信任措施會議，簡稱亞信，於1992年由哈薩克倡議建立，致力於制定和落實多邊信任措施，促進亞洲和平、安全與穩定。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_20261022_QQ.CICA.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KQP98X1Bw91792664786.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>經過34年的發展，亞信的合作規則和工作機制漸趨完善，成員國間互信合作不斷深化，合作領域從政策交流，延伸至農業援助、青年氣候行動等具體項目。</p><p></p><p>中國是亞信創始成員國，曾於2014至2018年擔任亞信輪值主席國，還創設亞信智庫論壇和金融峰會等對話機制，推動成員國開展專業交流。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_20261022_QQ.CICA.CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QsGfShTvCp1792664752.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>今屆峰會上，亞信正式接納老撾為新成員國，成員國增至29個，代表性進一步擴大。在亞洲安全格局深刻演變的背景下，亞信作為亞洲安全對話平台之一，其作用正變得愈發關鍵。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/10345-%E5%B0%88%E5%88%A9%E6%87%B8%E5%B4%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:03.983584+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.637781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:42.535471+00:00","content_hash":"4c8ca645ffe80a30611af643051b348261debc7388966a6c33dbb7ae60c7900b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:03.983584+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}